    <string name="mask_window_service_label">Sophiel opaque masks</string>
    <string name="mask_window_service_description">Draws Sophiel\'s masks fully opaque and protects its settings. With \"Peek under mask\" on, it screenshots the app under a mask to check it, in memory only. Receives window changes and reads text only in Settings, to find Sophiel.</string>

